{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Enable a disabled yum repo for one run and print yum variables from YumBase.","label":"Yum","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/xargs","label":"xargs","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/xargs"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/zip","label":"zip","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/zip"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEnable a disabled yum repo for one run and print yum variables from YumBase.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Enable a disabled repo<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>--enablerepo=webtatic<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUse this to use a repository that is otherwise disabled. Recommended to leave it disabled (<code class='inline'>enabled = 0<\/code>) to keep the installation state.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>yum.conf<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/etc\/yum.conf<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>yum variables<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>python -c 'import yum, pprint; yb = yum.YumBase(); pprint.pprint(yb.conf.yumvar, width=1)'<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Loaded plugins: fastestmirror\n{'arch': 'ia32e',\n 'basearch': 'x86_64',\n 'releasever': '5'}<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/yum\/notes' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/yum\/notes' data-title='Notes'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/os\/nix\/yum\/notes.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/nix\/yum\/notes\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Notes<\/div><\/div><\/a><\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/yum\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/yum\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/xargs' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/xargs' data-title='xargs' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>xargs<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/zip' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/zip' data-title='zip' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>zip<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image 